description: Auto-deploy JLM Website after changes unless user says local
alwaysApply: true
---

# Deploy policy

After completing any JLM Website change (copy, styling, layout, features, bug fixes, Worker/KV):

1. Run `npm run deploy` automatically — do **not** ask first.
2. Briefly confirm deployment in the reply.
3. **Skip deploy** only when the user explicitly says **local** (or clearly asks to keep changes local-only).

Do not warn about behavior vs styling changes before deploying. The user opts out with "local", not in.
